  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-family: Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">셩<ruby style=\"position: relative\">쉬<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative\">훼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_SY3mhilBIs?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">冷淡<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">롕ˆ담ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">使<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">수ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">랑-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">感覺<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">감ˆ각</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lì’e liêng-tām, sû-lang-kâm-kak\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">熱情<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뗻졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">欠債<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">캼`제</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goà’e riet-jiéng si-khiàm-je\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">所有<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">서ˆ우-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">疼惜<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">턀`숗</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">간<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">나<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">笑詼<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">쵸`퀘ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    sôr-u-thià̰-sioh, kān-nā-si-chiò-khuê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">原諒<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">꽌령-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">頭<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">ᄐᅷ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一擺<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇배`</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">對<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뒤`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">애</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">反背<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">환ˆ붸ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goan-liong-lî-thau-jit-pài, tùi-ai’e hoân-puē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> 됴<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">跳<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">ᄐᆤ`-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">入<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">띱ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心酸<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ승ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">大<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">돠-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">火<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">훼`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goà tio-thiàu-rîp, sīm-sn̂g’e toa-huè\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">感情<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">감ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愈<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뚜ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">重<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">당ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愈<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뚜ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愈<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뚜ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">慐<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">껑ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    kâm-jiéng rû-tāng, rû-lai-rû-gōng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">看<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">콸`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">뽀<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˏ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">事實<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">수싣ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">像<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">츌-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">痟<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">ᄉᆤ`</rt></ruby>’에\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    khoà̰-bó su-sît chiṵ-siàu’e\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一直<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">읻ˆ딛-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">做夢<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">죄`빵ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">生活<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">솅ˉ왛ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">캏<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">好<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">호ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">過<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">궤</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ît-tit-joè-bāng, siēng-oâh khâh-hô-kue\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">哪<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.3em\">나ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">著<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">둏-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"hiâh\">遐<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">햫ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">殘忍<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">잔띰`</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">講<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">老實<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">ᄅᅷ싣-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">話<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">웨ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lì nà tioh-hiâh-jan-rìm, kông-lau-sit-wē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">連<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">롄-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">곻<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">搬<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">봘ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">幸福<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">혱헉</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby>음<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">願<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">꽌-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">奉陪<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">헝붸ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lien-kôh-poā̰-hieng-hork, lông-m-goan-hong-pué\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">上<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">셩-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">媠<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">쉬`</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">花<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">훼ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">若<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">나-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">鑿<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">착-</rt></ruby>둏<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">심ˆ</rt></ruby> 마에<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">流血<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">ᄅᅷ휗</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    siong-sùi’e huê, na-si-chak-tioh-sîm ma-e-lau-hueh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">浪漫<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">렁빤ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">애</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">忽然<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">훋ˆ뗸-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">間<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">간ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">變<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">볜`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">風吹<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">헝ˉ췌ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    long-bān’e ai, hût-rien-kân pièn-hōng-chuê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    음<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">管<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">관ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">失眠<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">싣ˆ삔ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">幾<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">귀ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">落<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">롷-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">暝<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">메ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">目滓<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">빡새`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">流<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">ᄅᅷ-</rt></ruby>똬<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\"><span style=\"font-family: Noto Sans SC\">㩼</span><rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">죄ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    m-koân-sît-bín kûi-loh-mé, goâ-bak-sài lau-roa-joē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">猶原<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">유ˉ꽌-</rt></ruby>뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">發<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">홛ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">覺<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">각</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">苦<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">커ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">苦<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">커ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">留戀<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">류롼ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">夯枷<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">꺄게ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    yū-goan-bo-hoât-kak, khôr-khôr-liu-loán si-gia-ké\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">上<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">셩-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">媠<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">쉬`</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">花<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">훼ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">欲<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">飛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">붸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">看<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">콸`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心情<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> 뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">解說<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">개ˆ쉫</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    siong-sùi’e huê, bêh-puē-khoà̰-sīm-jiéng bo-kâi-sueh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">寂寞<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">셕ˆ뻑ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby>허<ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">情批<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">졩풰ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goà’e siôrk-bôrk, si-hor-lì’e jieng-phuê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">朋友<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">볭유`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">罵<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">메-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">太<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">태`-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">狼狽<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">령붸ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">綴<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뒈`-</rt></ruby>둏<ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">玲瑯<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">린ˉ렁ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">踅<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">셓ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    pieng-yù me-goà thài-liong-puē, tuè-tioh-lì līn-lōng-sêh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    음<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">知<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">度過<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">더궤`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">烏暗<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">어ˉ암</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">明月<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뼹뀋ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    m-jāi-lì si-goà, tor-kuè-ōr-am’e bieng-guêh\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">幾<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">귀ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">段<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">돨-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">感情<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">감ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">坎坎坷坷<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1em\">캄ˆ캄ˆ켿켿ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    kûi-toa̰-kâm-jiéng khâm-khâm-khiet-khiêt\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">早<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">자`</rt></ruby> 됴<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">貧惰<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">빈돨-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">求<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">규-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">啥貨<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">샬ˆ훼</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jà tio-pin-toa̰-kiu-siâ̰-hue\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">出現<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">춛ˆ혠ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">改變<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">개ˆ볜</rt></ruby>’<ruby style=\"position: relative\">ᄅᆤ<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一切<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">읻ˆ체</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lì’e chût-hiēn kâi-pien’liàu ît-che\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">飄浪<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄑᆤˉ렁ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">孤單<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">거ˉ돨ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">變做<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">볜`죄`-</rt></ruby>우<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">家<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">게ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goâ-phiāu-lōng’e kōr-toâ̰ pièn-joè-u-kê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">哪<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.3em\">나ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">知<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">란<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">緣份<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">옌훈ˉ</rt></ruby> 에<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">遐邇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">햫ˆ니</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">短<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">데`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    nà jāi-làn’e yen-hūn e-hiâh-ni-tè\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">上<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">셩-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">媠<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">쉬`</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">花<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">훼ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">欲<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">飛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">붸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">看<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">콸`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心情<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> 뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">解說<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">개ˆ쉫</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    siong-sùi’e huê, bêh-puē-khoà̰-sīm-jiéng bo-kâi-sueh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">寂寞<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">셕ˆ뻑ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby>허<ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">情批<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.